 a one-button system.","source_url":"https://rooms.lib.ecu.edu/video-recording-center","source_title":"Video Recording Center - Joyner Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Accommodates one to six people and requires selection through Joyner's room-reservation system; verify live availability.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ecu-joyner-special-collections-research-room","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Special Collections Research Room","title":"Work Directly With Archival Sources","subtitle":"Third-floor research room in Joyner Library","notes":"Request the materials you need before arrival and book at least 12 hours ahead unless you are an ECU student or faculty member seeking a walk-in opening.","short_summary":"A supervised research setting for consulting ECU's non-circulating archives and rare materials.","evidence_claim":"ECU states that archival and rare-book materials must be used in the repository's reading room and that Joyner's Special Collections Research Room became appointment-only on March 3, 2026.","source_url":"https://digital.lib.ecu.edu/special/ead/","source_title":"ECU Libraries Collection Guides","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Appointment required as of March 3, 2026. ECU students and faculty may request walk-in accommodation; other bookings require at least 12 hours' notice.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
